      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "The only wire into the DRAM die is a command on the C/A bus \u2192 loading G, running MAC, and draining the result are ALL host-issued commands (forced, not a design choice).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The only wire into the DRAM die is a command on the C/A bus \u2192 loading G, running MAC, and draining the result are ALL host-issued commands (forced, not a design choice).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12
    },
