      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "There is no ISA vocabulary for either \u2192 a compiler cannot reason about the data movement or its ordering. That gap is what the custom instructions sit in front of.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "There is no ISA vocabulary for either \u2192 a compiler cannot reason about the data movement or its ordering. That gap is what the custom instructions sit in front of.",
